Package: pomo
Architecture: all
Depends: bash (>= 4.0), libnotify-bin, ncurses-bin
Description: Eye-catching pomodoro timer TUI in pure Bash
 pomo is a terminal-based pomodoro timer with a large block-character
 countdown, a progress bar and per-mode colors. It supports pause/skip/quit
 keys, an automatic focus/break cycle (long break after every 4th focus
 session), desktop notifications and a simple session statistics view.
